# A rule no start symbol reaches is an error (it would be dead in the
# tables).
# error: unreachable_rule.grammar:15:1:
# error: rule 'dead' is unreachable: no start symbol reaches it
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[ \t\n]+ → skip
[a-z]+ → ident
. → err
@parser
prog! = IDENT                               → (p 1)
dead  = IDENT IDENT                         → (d 1)
